        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dear Madam Lilia:"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Welcome to the Radiant Feldspar's restaurant. Today, a very special person wishes for us to express his most heartfelt blessings to you on his behalf:"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Lilia,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "On this remarkable night, may you live a life that is full of endless love and affection. I love you, Lilia. My feelings for you will never change, even with the passing of time. I have prepared a surprise for you and I hope that you'll have fun tonight. :)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Mike\""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "On behalf of all the staff in our department, I offer our best wishes to you. Happy birthday! May you enjoy a magical night full of joy and merriment."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Radiant Feldspar Food & Beverage Department"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
